<title>POLAND: Polish minimum T-bill prices slip at tender.</title>
<headline>Polish minimum T-bill prices slip at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills fell at Monday's primary auction on total demand of 1.226 billion zlotys against a 1.4 billion zloty offer, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>The ministry sold 840 million zlotys of bills.</p>
<p>The ministry will offer 600 million zlotys worth of 52-week T-bills at its next primary tender on Wednesday, June 18. The payment date for this auction will be Friday, June 20, it said.  </p>
<p> T-bill	    8-week   13-week  26-week  39-week  52-week</p>
